    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "ダイタクヘリオス",
            "enName": "Daitaku Helios",
            "jpText": "アルダン先輩ちょりーす！　ウェーイ！",
            "enText": "It's Ardan, let's gooo! Wahey!",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 1138683720164084759,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロアルダン",
            "enName": "Mejiro Ardan",
            "jpText": "ヘリオスさんはいつも元気で楽しいですね。\r\n私も見習いたいです。",
            "enText": "You're always so cheerful and bubbly.\nI wish I could take a leaf from your book.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 3348519975177180622,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ダイタクヘリオス",
            "enName": "Daitaku Helios",
            "jpText": "挨拶だけで褒められた！\r\nマジうれぴよっ！",
            "enText": "All I did was say hello, and you're already\nshook? My rizz is off the charts today!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -8216886686569688546,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロアルダン",
            "enName": "Mejiro Ardan",
            "jpText": "ところで、『ウェーイ』というのは\r\nどういう意味なのでしょうか？",
            "enText": "By the way, what does \"wahey\" mean?",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": 1549682589893966941,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ダイタクヘリオス",
            "enName": "Daitaku Helios",
            "jpText": "それはもうバイブスぶち上げの時に\r\n自然と出てくる言葉ってゆーか、\nとりま言っとけ的な！",
            "enText": "It just, like, comes out naturally when you're\nhyped. You know, when the vibes are lit!",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 7093323806405226215,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロアルダン",
            "enName": "Mejiro Ardan",
            "jpText": "ぶち上げ……とりま……節々が不明ですが、\r\nニュアンスは伝わりました。\n元気を共有する挨拶、ということですね。",
            "enText": "Hyped? …Lit? I don't fully understand,\nbut I think I get the gist. It's akin to a\nfriendly greeting.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": -442412173049012541,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロアルダン",
            "enName": "Mejiro Ardan",
            "jpText": "ヘリオスさん、ちょりーす。ウェーイ。",
            "enText": "Helios, let's gooo! Wahey!",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -8160931163444677166,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ダイタクヘリオス",
            "enName": "Daitaku Helios",
            "jpText": "うはー！　アルダン先輩ぎゃんかわ！\r\nてかギャル語なのに上品なのヤバすぎ！\n新ジャンルの幕開けじゃね！？",
            "enText": "Whoa! Slay, Ardan! It sounds so bougie\nwhen you say it! It's giving party princess!",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 952419640567598487,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロアルダン",
            "enName": "Mejiro Ardan",
            "jpText": "喜んでいただけたようで幸いです。\r\nふふ、ウェーイは素敵な言葉ですね。",
            "enText": "I'm glad you liked it. Hehe! \"Wahey\" is a\nwonderful word, isn't it?",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 1629159105099476931,
            "blockIdx": 9
        }
    ],
    "modified": 1780176431,
    "humanTl": true
}